                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>In Michael letter No. 1, November 24, the First Secretary of Embassy in the
                    United Kingdom (Jones) informed Mr. Henderson of information from Michael Wright
                    that both the political and economic papers had been approved by the British
                    Government (Lot 55–D36). The Michael letters were a special series of informal
                    communications sent to the Department by the Embassy in London detailing
                    conversations with Michael Wright on the recently completed talks in
                    Washington.</p>
            </div>
